NEW YORK - Edgar Allen, who
once managed Peaches Browning in
vaudeville, is suing her for the
return of gifts. City marshals visited her apartment and demanded
2 candelabra, 1 cocktail set, 1 cup
and coffee set; 1 drawing room lamp;
2 sets of books; blue pajama coat;
1 ring; 1 bridge set, gold dishes;
1 lemonade set. They went away
with some of the articles.

